#tr.ts: mišil manā šalāšat šiqil kaspam
#tr.en: 33 shekel of silver

2. _ki_ inim-{d}nanna 
#tr.ts: itti inim-nanna
#tr.en: from Inim-nanna

3. ARAD-{d}suen _dumu_ ka-ar-sza-ia 
#tr.ts: warad-sîn mār karšaya
#tr.en: Warad-sîn son of Karšaya

4. _szu ba-an-ti_ 
#tr.ts: ilqe
#tr.en: has borrowed.

5. _2(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2 a-<sza3>_ i-na e-bi-ir-tim 
#tr.ts: šinā u mišil ikû eqlam ina ebirtim
#tr.en: A field of 250 SAR on the other bank

6. i-na na-gi-im 
#tr.ts: ina nagîm
#tr.en: in the district,

7. i-na ta-wi-ir-tim 
#tr.ts: ina tarwitim
#tr.en: in the large (from next line) arable land

8. ra-bi-tim sza i-li-li 
#tr.ts: rabîtim ša ilili
#tr.en: of Ilili

9. i-na _mar{ar}_-gi-im 
#tr.ts: ina margîm
#tr.en: in Margûm,

10. _ki_ ARAD-{d}suen inim-{d}nanna 
