#tr.en: Inim-nanna from Warad-sîn

11. _a-sza3 szu ba-an-ti_ 
#tr.ts: eqlam ilqe
#tr.en: has received the field.

12. _a-sza3 u3 ku3-babbar_ i-ta-t,a3-lu 
#tr.ts: eqlum u kaspum i(t)taṭalū
#tr.en: Field and silver are of equal value.

13. a-na e-bu-ri-im 
#tr.ts: ana ebūrim
